  {
    "pipelineId": "item:ossuary:s14:copied_custody_page",
    "name": "Copied Custody Page",
    "type": "loot",
    "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-signatures-red.webp",
    "system": {
      "description": {
        "value": "<p>A certified copy of a custody ledger page. One entry: Named. Held: the place where even time cannot leave. Tag: outstanding.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-02590d8ce2f28a3e\"><p><strong>GM note.</strong> Sabeline shows it at Table Seven [ASK] (Scene 3, Clue E), or Pringus finds the line during an audit. Anyone who has read the Stolen Shard sees the same words. It is the custody record for T5: the intake ledger and this page agree, the physical tag is the third record. Sabeline's sheet also carries a copy (Copied Open-Claim Page); hand out this one if the party keeps it.</p></section>",
        "chat": ""
      },
      "source": {
