    "pipelineId": "item:ossuary:s14:mottles_receipt_room_208",
    "name": "Mottle's Receipt (Room 208)",
    "type": "loot",
    "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-writing-brown.webp",
    "system": {
      "description": {
        "value": "<p>Paid in advance. Three nights. Instead of a signature, someone drew a bell.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-3afa5595cecb35a7\"><p><strong>GM note.</strong> Scene 1, Clue B: Mottle's ledger entry for Europa's room (\"He did not sign. He drew a bell. I have not agreed to that.\"). The man who paid was tall, with frost in his hair. Put to Pell together with Europa's frost: Insight DC 13 and he admits the far end is up at the camp.</p></section>",
        "chat": ""
      },
      "source": {
