    "pipelineId": "item:ossuary:s14:capsule_bell_silent",
    "name": "Capsule: Bell Silent",
    "type": "loot",
    "img": "icons/commodities/tech/pipe-tube-glass-brass.webp",
    "system": {
      "description": {
        "value": "<p>A capsule with a bone-style tag. The letter reads: Bell silent. Clapper taken to the Customs House. Bailiffs on the road. V. keeps the fire.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-1222e9f39258492c\"><p><strong>GM note.</strong> Scene 7, Clue H: drops into the dusty terminal when the cold door opens (T6 success), same single clunk as the Part 6 notes. If the party refuses the Thaw, Pell brings it to them anyway (\"You should know anyway\"). Nobody in the Thaw explains who V. is this session.</p></section>",
        "chat": ""
      },
