    "pipelineId": "item:ossuary:s14:iron_bars_haddos_stock",
    "name": "Iron Bars (Haddo's Stock)",
    "type": "loot",
    "img": "icons/commodities/metal/ingot-worn-iron.webp",
    "system": {
      "description": {
        "value": "<p>Four bars of old iron, bought off a salvage cart. They look alike.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-570b147c6421d90b\"><p><strong>GM note.</strong> T2 at Brokka's forge (Scenes spec: on the anvil bench). Analyze, free, one careful 10 minutes covers all four, DC 12 sorts them; the results are in Session 14 T2 and in Haddo's Lore Reference: Three Strands. Do not say which bar is which before the roll. Haddo sells bar stock at 5 sp each.</p></section>",
        "chat": ""
