  {
    "pipelineId": "item:ossuary:s14:iron_rune_wire",
    "name": "Iron Rune-Wire",
    "type": "loot",
    "img": "icons/commodities/tech/wire-spool-steel.webp",
    "system": {
      "description": {
        "value": "<p>A coil of fine iron wire, freshly drawn from a single bar at Brokka's forge.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-931a21f53a8a39ee\"><p><strong>GM note.</strong> T2 product: draw the clean bar into wire, smith's tools DC 12 (Dale or anyone; Brokka's help gives advantage). Counts as suitable material for Stellan's Repair Line on the anchor (T1); with the old wire T1 is at disadvantage. The rest is the wire strand of the braid (T6). If the wrong bar was drawn, it looks the same: T1 is at disadvantage until someone notices.</p></section>",
        "chat": ""
      },
