    "name": "Jar of Gorge Frost",
    "type": "loot",
    "img": "icons/consumables/potions/potion-jar-capped-teal.webp",
    "system": {
      "description": {
        "value": "<p>A stoppered jar of frost that never fully melts.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-cfc99ee21c38a83a\"><p><strong>GM note.</strong> Pell's jar (his sheet carries one too: use either, not both). T2 frost match: Analyze this and the frost on the Stolen Shard, DC 14. Extract one Rime dose (Stable, automatic, 10 minutes; free at rest, otherwise 1 charge); then the jar is empty. It can also be the slow sinker on the real night.</p></section>",
        "chat": ""
      },
