  {
    "pipelineId": "item:ossuary:s14:rime_dose",
    "name": "Rime Dose (Gorge Frost)",
    "type": "loot",
    "img": "icons/consumables/potions/vial-cork-blue.webp",
    "system": {
      "description": {
        "value": "<p>A prepared dose of rime drawn from the gorge frost. It is cold to hold and never fully melts.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-d7bdfd817702f2ab\"><p><strong>GM note.</strong> Created by Dale's Extract Dose from the Jar of Gorge Frost (T2). Use Dale's Essencecrafting sheet for it: Apply Essence (1 charge plus this dose) to the braid preserves organic matter for 24 hours, so the linen and the fungal strand survive the cold. Without it the fungal strand freezes within an hour (T3). 7.9 lets Dale keep one extra Rime dose as a reward; the jar's yield is finite. No time essence.</p></section>",
        "chat": ""
      },
      "source": {
