    "name": "Burial Linen Strand (30 ft)",
    "type": "loot",
    "img": "icons/commodities/cloth/thread-spindle-white.webp",
    "system": {
      "description": {
        "value": "<p>Clean white burial linen, cut and twisted into a thirty-foot strand for braiding.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-f6fd011d37660bf0\"><p><strong>GM note.</strong> From Harrowgate's Counter (burial linen, 5 sp per yard; this is ten yards). The linen strand of the braid: it holds shape and carries nothing. Needs the Rime dose applied (T2) to last in the cold.</p></section>",
