  {
    "pipelineId": "item:ossuary:s14:living_fungal_strand",
    "name": "Living Fungal Strand (30 ft)",
    "type": "loot",
    "img": "icons/commodities/cloth/thread-spindle-grey-green.webp",
    "system": {
      "description": {
        "value": "<p>A thirty-foot strand of pale, living fungal thread, grown from a culture kept in a glass case. It is faintly cool to the touch.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-5f433f0885a7b3e5\"><p><strong>GM note.</strong> T3 at Ysolde's: Read Green Pattern (free, DC 12), then Quickening (1 charge) DC 13 grows the 30-ft strand (failure: 10 ft; a second Quickening finishes it). Tie Green Thread (1 charge, 10 minutes) links it to the culture case, which stays at the near knot: that is the signal. It freezes within an hour without the Rime dose. Violet's craft reads the fungus only.</p></section>",
        "chat": ""
      },
      "source": {
