    "name": "Braided Line (30 ft)",
    "type": "loot",
    "img": "icons/sundries/survival/rope-coil-white.webp",
    "system": {
      "description": {
        "value": "<p>Three strands braided together: white linen, fine iron wire, and a pale living fungal thread.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-c276b8cd81dd894f\"><p><strong>GM note.</strong> T6 at Haddo's ropewalk: needs T1, T2 and T3. Someone holds tension while Haddo braids: Dexterity (weaver's tools or Sleight of Hand) DC 12; failure is a kink and 20 minutes lost. Then the test pull at the cold door (the Bell knock, Performance or Wisdom DC 12). The party carries the far end out through the cold door. Narrative object: it is rope, with no other property.</p></section>",
        "chat": ""
