  {
    "pipelineId": "item:ossuary:s14:anchor_rune_stone",
    "name": "Anchor Rune-Stone (Cold Door)",
    "type": "loot",
    "img": "icons/commodities/stone/engraved-symbol-water-grey.webp",
    "system": {
      "description": {
        "value": "<p>A palm-wide stone set in the right-hand jamb of an old iron service door, cut with two worn runes. It looks like ordinary masonry until you look closely.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-affa54ae6af01b98\"><p><strong>GM note.</strong> Not portable: a fixture of the cold door (Scene 7 map object Anchor_Stone). This item is a reference card for T1; do not give it to a player sheet. Perception DC 13 or Read Inscription (free, DC 13) to notice and read it; properties in the order given in Session 14 T1. Repair Line twice (1 charge, 1 minute, DC 14 each): Fraying, Strained, Stable. Clean wire from T2 or disadvantage. Success: it hums faintly when anyone taps four slow near it.</p></section>",
        "chat": ""
      },
