    "type": "loot",
    "img": "icons/tools/instruments/bell-brass-brown.webp",
    "system": {
      "description": {
        "value": "<p>A heavy iron bell clapper, wrapped in sacking and tied with a Customs House seizure tag.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-a6187b94336dbeb8\"><p><strong>GM note.</strong> Session 15, not Session 14. The camp bell's clapper, held by the Iron Bailiffs at Bridgehollow's Customs House (the capsule's \"Clapper taken to the Customs House\"). The far knot needs the camp bell rung in the Bell knock, so the party has to recover it. The reason for the seizure is only what the Thaw thinks (an unlicensed signal).</p></section>",
        "chat": ""
