    "type": "loot",
    "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-official-capital.webp",
    "system": {
      "description": {
        "value": "<p>An Exchange permit, sealed and countersigned, for one irregular transfer through a named threshold. Valid once.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-16f4e972cf532070\"><p><strong>GM note.</strong> Scene 5 only, and only if won: Persuasion DC 17 with the T5 audit done, or Pringus speaks for the records. It makes the later return fully legal. A delay (DC 15) or a lie (DC 16) does not earn it.</p></section>",
